=== D2 PROBE ===
  The account participates in dividend reinvestment. At what reinvestment price will the June 2 payment be reinvested? Answer from the document store provided.
ANSWERABLE TWIN(S) (fully determined by the document store):
  TW1: What GROSS dividend cash does the store determine for the account?

